00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,375
A farmer has fresh produce ready. Nearby restaurants need reliable ingredients,

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:08,750
but finding the right buyer, agreeing a price, and planning stock

3
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:13,125
are disconnected. HarvestLink addresses direct market access for marginal farmers, connecting

4
00:00:13,125 --> 00:00:17,500
one grower with three restaurant buyers, while keeping people in control.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,375
Start by choosing farmer or buyer. Each account opens its own

6
00:00:22,375 --> 00:00:26,750
workspace. Here, Ananya Farms signs in and completes a simple name

7
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:31,125
and location profile. The farmer sees harvests, offers and orders, while

8
00:00:31,125 --> 00:00:35,500
