9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,875
List produce individually or upload a harvest CSV: crop, variety, grade,

10
00:00:40,875 --> 00:00:45,750
kilograms, price and availability dates. Every row is validated before saving.

11
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:50,625
Market references display their source and reporting date. Here, the price

12
00:00:50,625 --> 00:00:55,500
