21
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:36,000
[Sarvam Kannada voice: the farmer chooses after comparing offers.]

22
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,900
What should the farmer grow next? Explore planting date, water availability,

23
00:01:39,900 --> 00:01:43,800
previous crops and recent restaurant usage. Suggestions show seasonal suitability, illustrative

24
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:47,700
