33
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,900
The buyer reviews the recommended quantity and approves a purchase requirement.

34
00:02:23,900 --> 00:02:27,800
In agent settings, the restaurant controls its maximum unit price, total

35
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:31,700
budget and service radius. Marketplace listings connect that need to available

36
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:35,600
