38
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:44,875
Three restaurant agents negotiate against the farmer’s limits. Compare quantities, prices

39
00:02:44,875 --> 00:02:49,750
and negotiation steps. Collection distances help compare nearby buyers, but are

40
00:02:49,750 --> 00:02:54,625
illustrative; road routing is not connected. The farmer chooses The Green

41
00:02:54,625 --> 00:02:59,500
Table. Selection still requires the buyer’s agreement.

42
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:03,500
The selected restaurant reviews and confirms the agreement. Only then is

43
00:03:03,500 --> 00:03:07,000
