44
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:10,500
The order visibly separates confirmation from funding, so an unconfirmed proposal

45
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:14,000
cannot be mistaken for a paid order. No real money moves

46
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:17,500
