49
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:29,700
funds. Each step is visible in the order timeline. Explicit participant

50
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:33,600
actions and inventory checks keep the trade inspectable, from the first

51
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:37,500
